{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "5c3270ed3ca35fd8096f57e223f8ab1c77469e99e44afe7aa94f614e13e8335c", "ja": "小さな勇気", "zh": "小小的勇气", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "69f359f3f720b6b3b97cf875b89739e6265205a3c6cc2763ae52ebf4d7c48938", "ja": "ひとり落ち込んでいる亜利沙の元へ、春香と\nプロデューサーがやってきて、亜利沙を励ま\nす。桃子ものり子と奈緒と共に合流。\n桃子は亜利沙に謝り、ふたりは仲直りする。", "zh": "春香和制作人找到正在独自难过的亚利沙，\n两人一起鼓励她。\n后来桃子也和法子以及奈绪一起来了。\n桃子向亚利沙道歉，两个人言归于好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1000_028ari", "source_sha256": "d73899f0bef03126c1d3397561ad649011c196ff51e918841556c737f9b0855f", "ja": "はぁ……。ありさ、また桃子ちゃんセンパイを\n怒らせてしまいました……。", "zh": "唉……亚利沙又害小桃前辈生气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "ffc8edd1ad4722b42fcf46761d77cf564f55c3cb28df36e7f4bdf6b463977dd7", "ja": "アイドルになって、初めてお友達がたくさんできて。\nリコッタのみんなとも仲良くなれたと思ったのに……。", "zh": "当了偶像之后才第一次交到这么多朋友。\n本来还觉得跟『Ricotta』的大家处得不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "b78df595a8e85948ff06f6740d5a7c5e9b7865c9422f7315bf42209648e0c130", "ja": "ありさ、空気が読めなくて、\n余計なことばっかりしちゃってるみたいです……。", "zh": "亚利沙不会看气氛，\n好像老是不小心做了多余的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "974a84163ea4611e7045cd9180ef91f0a4c5c888286dc12b1309785e0d40a3bf", "ja": "そうかな？\nでも私は、そんな亜利沙ちゃんが好きだけどなぁ。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n不过我很喜欢这样的亚利沙喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "fe3bdf9745f3065c5b1531a3185e8653570f114b5142265261ffd706f0ee4d32", "ja": "は、春香さん！\nそれに、{$P$}さんも！？", "zh": "春、春香！\n{$P$}先生也来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4b585dd686b23bb261bc4e30043c50c91f4a42ffbb08a2af60a781bd610c9404", "ja": "亜利沙だからこその、いいところ……\n俺もたくさん見せてもらって来たよ。", "zh": "亚利沙独特的优点……\n我也一直都有注意到喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "68bc5fda1842125ecd72094867a9715841fb2405c34ed92eafc2eb9222b2f4f1", "ja": "きっと、みんなもそう言うと思うよ？\n今の亜利沙ちゃんのことが、大好きだって。", "zh": "我想大家一定也会说，\n她们最喜欢现在的亚利沙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "45c357dff9b0f8e56b9bdebe7453dbb71b53cf02b91ea932540181becab19bdf", "ja": "春香さん……うう……。\nありさも、春香さんやみんなのことは大好きです……。", "zh": "春香……呜……\n亚利沙也最喜欢春香和大家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "8bddd48b1bbd5fe985567d2d548614579c47b9f74c31635cd023e866ed021161", "ja": "ケド……桃子ちゃんセンパイはきっと、ありさのこと、\n嫌いになっちゃったと思います……。", "zh": "但是……\n小桃前辈一定变得讨厌亚利沙了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "02d497da843ea45bfd12e39733b530750e9dc2368773a9d4dd6c2cbbe9a73009", "ja": "ありさ、桃子ちゃんにいっぱい注意してもらったのに。\nダメダメなことばっかりしちゃったから……うう……。", "zh": "明明桃子提醒了亚利沙这么多次，\n亚利沙却还一直犯错……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "7a00471f2ea71f50a78b117bcd104b9623b1373478372ab5f6bf2e9d99f539ba", "ja": "桃子ちゃんだって、亜利沙ちゃんのこと、\n嫌いなわけじゃないと思うけどな。", "zh": "我觉得桃子应该也不是真的讨厌亚利沙喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "b7ad6cdfaa46d762720ee43d8f864efe7df4cc099f575f4402a938e18bb91096", "ja": "それに……本当に嫌いだったら、\n心配で探しにきたりしないよ。ね？", "zh": "而且……如果真的讨厌你，\n就不会担心到跑来找你了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1013_se", "source_sha256": "a0c5d8fa890a98216657d0ee88fde0fbdf705f184b2371f6e25888115ce773d7", "ja": "ガサ……", "zh": "沙沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1014_null", "source_sha256": "67dc603f888c2fb5afb0220157d54c4e7307655802f611e7d575d0aae20a8d21", "ja": "―少し前―", "zh": "──不久前──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "70cd24bfb408936efb5ca7ca2fabaa1cdd5098678410fd61dcd8702147032b7e", "ja": "それじゃ、みんなはここにいてくれ。\n俺と春香は、ちょっと亜利沙を探してくるから。", "zh": "那大家先留在这里，\n我跟春香去找亚利沙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "d18823d58da77d5f775770e2215247347ec6295755b9e3cc41923902fe5d283d", "ja": "私は向こう側を探します。\nみんな、また後でね！", "zh": "我去找另一边，\n大家待会见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "3cef8dedf03d0031b953b95582cc8247b72ed990bbda3698285cf167a0dd5c3c", "ja": "さてと～。\nほら、桃子。私らも行こか♪", "zh": "好了啦～\n走啦，桃子，我们也去找吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "be1cc98ce57381a1b11e864ff1dbf61929fa8db3f090636c0982db7b1dffca40", "ja": "そ、そんなこと言われても……\n桃子が行ったら、亜利沙さんは……。", "zh": "就算你这么说……\n如果桃子去了，亚利沙姊会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "5a52b7eea218bce8f20d42522ecec14b4499c75688a3403ff70b82fe519fc3f7", "ja": "コラっ、桃子！\n亜利沙のこと、人任せにしていいの？", "zh": "喂，桃子！\n你把亚利沙的事情都交给别人，这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "2172fe4518e2652a9fd891c94aa8338ef4fee4b79662fc9ebb85013ac6b20251", "ja": "で、でも……。", "zh": "但、但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca4f3fec7670378d497588fff2ca7ac211e175cecf935c74074b0e2501a54760", "ja": "でも、なにっ？　言っておくけど、\nアタシは言いわけは聞かないからね！", "zh": "但是什么？\n丑话先说在前头，我可不会听你说任何借口！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "a4f91cd68f68efcdcb9a2f3b498545ac6faf462dfc0455956931289fe8533987", "ja": "あきらめるんは、まだ早いんとちゃうかな～？\n今なら間に合うし、一緒に行こっ。な？", "zh": "要放弃好像太早了吼～？\n现在还来得及呀，一起去吧，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1025_null", "source_sha256": "753cef7fc67aa9cf57dba7161c5ff542f07edb7ab24c1d4e079f24f0a18ae18f", "ja": "―現在―", "zh": "──现在──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1026_se", "source_sha256": "a0c5d8fa890a98216657d0ee88fde0fbdf705f184b2371f6e25888115ce773d7", "ja": "ガサ……", "zh": "沙沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "cbdf19e3ad4fbd747aada4ac1369ac660daad06e7aea60f706df4b5f3ac9f37a", "ja": "あ、いたいた！\nもー、亜利沙ってばこんなトコにいたの？", "zh": "啊，找到人了！\n真是的，亚利沙你居然在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "50c29f84000bd102b02decce550dc2dc0862cba5d1ca1fc1242e8657113eff1c", "ja": "ホンマ探したわ～って、\nまだ劇場内しか探してへんけどな！", "zh": "我们真的找得好辛苦啊～\n虽然还只找了剧场里面啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "b70fafa0feaf3fbea669d73301e756be727ff47a36cf3fa5691b4687955a8b1a", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃんセンパイ！？\nそれに奈緒ちゃん、のり子ちゃんも……。", "zh": "小、小桃前辈！？\n还有奈绪跟小法也来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4ea1efbc36ef0ed0f6eed259bec9ec4f26b521cd616e55fa5cbca4c70ee380f2", "ja": "桃子……。そうか。\nみんな、来てくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "桃子……这样啊。\n大家，谢谢你们来找她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "9357109600ab7a8ca37ff2b77c1e39b6fb4cb80c9cb7cb0b0cf2816161ef4ae7", "ja": "ほら、桃子。\n亜利沙に何か言うことがあるんでしょ？", "zh": "来，桃子，\n你应该有什么话要对亚利沙说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1033_049mom", "source_sha256": "b18cf36ca76aa7d016fdb239efbfd41ed73fd8a4081b36169482cd846a1a34f2", "ja": "う……。\nあ、亜利沙さん！", "zh": "呜……\n亚、亚利沙姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "852954013e7b6d19a5f8f18b05db685aa06a5ea17f8d33bca6ed8dd0c556cf16", "ja": "は、はいぃっ！", "zh": "什、什么事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "db1d4984cc178862829450d792bdccc8e42106f9a1c38a63a669ce41ec6183fe", "ja": "……さっきは、桃子も言いすぎたかも。\nごめんなさい……。", "zh": "……刚刚桃子可能说得太过分了。\n对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "b1ebd6f93c5c3017cf8705be36263729ed287d279383139f4ff695b5d9e735de", "ja": "そ、そんなっ、謝らないでください！　ありさが\n勝手なことばっかりしてたのがダメなんですから！", "zh": "怎、怎么会，不要说对不起啦！\n都怪亚利沙老是擅作主张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1037_049mom", "source_sha256": "506ad1ef6246b82a3daf41e2507c41d20c6c8ecbae5e68f6937d3d67d29d273a", "ja": "うん、亜利沙さんのそういうところ、\n本当にダメだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，亚利沙姊这一点真的不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "45f9bbf186fc9dcaaf240fcd524c07fc36c4f4985a01a1fde623953101a332c9", "ja": "ぐさっ！", "zh": "呜咿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "c98968a50a5dd5e6b1b9f6831b2ff6c5716c89c1800f9af976af5acafdc62bab", "ja": "でも、それって桃子たちの……\nリコッタのためにしてくれたことなんだよね。", "zh": "不过那也是为了桃子我们……\n为了『Ricotta』做的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1040_049mom", "source_sha256": "52e4558e038f0237284dd3286957f4c189b32aa03ba04e3bea1ed592ee3a3401", "ja": "桃子、それがわかったから……。\nだから……。", "zh": "桃子明白这一点……\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "82b42bcd2ef29a2dca415171ba6346794b70668c73ae701079ecdf00d0404839", "ja": "桃子ちゃん……。", "zh": "桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "d3da591741c3d415713b584baef836a3407c0627a40dad3e2426c525c59fc858", "ja": "桃子、亜利沙さんが作ってきたアルバム見て、\nホントにびっくりしちゃった。", "zh": "桃子看到亚利沙姊做的相簿，\n真的吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1043_049mom", "source_sha256": "27f0f10caef3a4635a7c2c85326c2fae7a0720f987485eb7d1b4a8c354c962ef", "ja": "あんなこと、桃子にはできないし……。\n桃子は指導係なのに、練習遅れちゃってるし……。", "zh": "桃子没办法做出那样的东西……\n而且桃子明明是小老师，练习进度却落后大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1045_049mom", "source_sha256": "fe243e063e5d5dfbd1bbe93cec6b1dfb813caf2e39f69d3cba07f5a90ffe227a", "ja": "だから、すごく不安になって。\nそれで……それで……。", "zh": "所以开始觉得非常焦虑。\n所以……所以才会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1046_028ari", "source_sha256": "46fa66129713d48fcd277efc89e3a43738f4f37b6046e33207f60801ee6251e1", "ja": "い、いいんですよ桃子ちゃん！　ありさは少しでも、\n桃子ちゃんのお手伝いができたらと思っただけで……！", "zh": "没、没关系啦，桃子！\n亚利沙只是想多少帮一点桃子的忙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1047_049mom", "source_sha256": "c7d523b5f27ee8ce04f7afc7384d4cf0a2cec0060515b7e1c200f085f58817bb", "ja": "そんなの……亜利沙さんのくせに、なまいきだよ。", "zh": "想帮忙……亚利沙姊，你太看得起自己了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1048_028ari", "source_sha256": "f2e09a63f457c56fa5e3e99f593ff706d3085da168e7a7c05fc39fcefda06b6e", "ja": "ぐはぁ！？", "zh": "呜哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1049_037nao", "source_sha256": "9089755c2b31f834ff2c24160c92cc4c19a2f9c40a227034323697fee4912af0", "ja": "亜利沙が着実にダメージを受けとるわ……。", "zh": "亚利沙受到了扎扎实实的一击啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1050_043nor", "source_sha256": "a2ac0419e964f1d58ade489843bdc22c00ea87b5b62e3924a747a7a7891d1f10", "ja": "うん……なんか、すごいね桃子って……。", "zh": "嗯……感觉桃子好厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1051_001har", "source_sha256": "51a5c2ec53445b4477f1844066b6c61c9390d95944b818977fb305e765fe778a", "ja": "あはは……。\nそ、それだけ、仲良しってことじゃないかなっ？", "zh": "哈哈……\n这、这不是代表她们感情很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "f26851f34cbcdd8e8c391512218932940d8514c10dbe1c052409f69361597cfd", "ja": "（そうだろうか……）", "zh": "（是这样吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1053_049mom", "source_sha256": "4d225ee2a9e8c1c1db05c8d53ea770c7bdefdc11279ea6ec385841a86f02d65e", "ja": "でも……亜利沙さんは亜利沙さんで、がんばって\nくれたんだよね。なのに、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "不过……亚利沙姊也用自己的方式在努力，\n但是桃子却……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1054_049mom", "source_sha256": "743e8f64385fff0965d2950d967285699081d3ea1a3cede85f84037cc8755a83", "ja": "亜利沙さんのこと、少しなら、その……\nみ、認めてあげてもいいよ……。", "zh": "那个，要桃子……稍微肯定亚利沙姊……\n也不是不行啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1055_028ari", "source_sha256": "681a7d9065276750774acc14d762d75126744b3dce734b7bc2ad39db9ef04ed4", "ja": "も……桃子ちゃんセンパイ……！？\nふぉおお～！　キュンとくるお言葉いただきました～！", "zh": "小……小桃前辈……！？\n唔喔喔喔～！听到了令人怦然心动的一句话～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1057_028ari", "source_sha256": "3b793880ee3f1162be5e8fd96958474175b1caad6b3a636ca8618bff4542f429", "ja": "……はっ！？\nち、ちがうんです！　ありさはその……！", "zh": "……啊！？\n不、不是的！亚利沙是说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1058_049mom", "source_sha256": "a832ae67bb2d860d8197e00f78919f7a4f969e08de89ae5afecf80ca24d91e08", "ja": "はぁ……もういいよ、わかってるってば。\n……これからも、一緒にレッスンがんばろうね？", "zh": "唉……好了啦，桃子知道你要说什么。\n……以后也一起努力练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1059_028ari", "source_sha256": "19ec8f64eac38354f76d07f554c1599967db55e68e4bd52a85e9ae123288060a", "ja": "は、はい……！\nあの～、桃子ちゃん……ひとつ聞いてもいいですか？", "zh": "好、好的……！\n那个～桃子……可以问你一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1060_049mom", "source_sha256": "f91645fe5675826789fedc10aab256942c7a5f76c6628fe72b0e650b7393b4dd", "ja": "いいよ。なに？", "zh": "可以呀，要问什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1061_028ari", "source_sha256": "4095bb56ac28b2147cce31d79859a28688fa635bdc6a660123176e57cfc63727", "ja": "桃子ちゃんはありさのコト……\nす、すすす…、好き、ですか？", "zh": "桃子……\n喜、喜喜喜……喜欢亚利沙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1062_049mom", "source_sha256": "ef6b25f9f159a546cc049745eeacc27bd1ebf47ae23c00d5f538e91dc7b4585f", "ja": "は、はぁ！？　別に、好きとかじゃないよ！\nフツウ！", "zh": "什、什么！？才没有什么喜欢不喜欢！\n普通而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1063_028ari", "source_sha256": "1b5fc0dcdcebfd407c7d6592a0cefcdc4fa2561d794a8bcaa57dc566a5fe930c", "ja": "フツウ……。", "zh": "普通……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1064_001har", "source_sha256": "88adfbd263175fc396c170501cb068306ad4bc2e97baefe6287ddb980e9dbb93", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、亜利沙ちゃん！　これから、もーっと\n仲良くなれるって意味……そうだよね、桃子ちゃん♪", "zh": "不要担心，亚利沙！\n她的意思是以后感情还可以变得更好……对吧，桃子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1065_028ari", "source_sha256": "d892b886cb1ba68b7ee87e4bed6aceccff5c82f67fbeaaa182b3d2271b19d3ae", "ja": "春香さん……。\nありさは、ありさは……！", "zh": "春香……\n亚利沙，亚利沙……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1066_028ari", "source_sha256": "7f5676883e5b0e14dd1b2f5c23189832f0bbb792fbe74c142212f778c37ba6e3", "ja": "ううっ、桃子ちゃんセンパイーっ！", "zh": "呜呜……小桃前辈──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1067_049mom", "source_sha256": "8676f29eb1851a7e247c05516ec7c7f2825a9584fbe7d59154c258cc6346d391", "ja": "ひゃっ！？\nあ、亜利沙さん、くっつかないで！", "zh": "呀！？\n亚、亚利沙姊，不要黏过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1068_043nor", "source_sha256": "b333d33b67d03bfa1ea4b16a31da86c8ccff8f754e81d81bf438317a60e8a6dc", "ja": "いや～よかったよかった！\nふたりとも、素直になったみたいだね♪", "zh": "哎呀～可喜可贺！\n看起来她们两个终于诚实面对自己的心情了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1069_037nao", "source_sha256": "b468d11b7c35ad55afd1737b5284e1b504792563b448ceff97f93a5269946872", "ja": "ま、ひとりは最初っからず～っと、\n素直になっとった気もするけどな♪", "zh": "嗯，虽然有一个人好像从一开始就很诚实啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1070_p", "source_sha256": "87090c7c4c1a1acb824c23d76adb92f5e0dd63b40f2045a8b116e912d1a0b1c7", "ja": "のり子、奈緒。\nふたりとも、助かったよ。", "zh": "法子、奈绪。\n谢谢你们，帮了不少忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1071_043nor", "source_sha256": "293267eb7321e65cc0ca028f8ed81ffcc6bf7558f5e02847cc8302e42aacfd54", "ja": "やだな、{$P$}。\nアタシ達は別に、なにもしてないって！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}。\n我们两个没做什么啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1072_037nao", "source_sha256": "811ac7f88c8745a85425362cd264f609ed8d41f0be4bbd0d733d02ac586fb15f", "ja": "私らは、ただ桃子連れてきただけやもんな♪", "zh": "我们就只是把桃子带来这里而已呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1073_p", "source_sha256": "2f69fe0029b540f71ccde53857714825a01f4273b793946eb8a831744810c5fb", "ja": "それが一番難しくて、大事なことだったからな。\n本当にありがとう。", "zh": "那才是最困难，却最重要的事情。\n真的很感谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1074_049mom", "source_sha256": "ec973316a010f695935e9fd9b81558e0e16a07ff4c0f060a38552582a66f58df", "ja": "いい？　亜利沙さん。これからレッスンの\n15分前には、ちゃんと事務所に来てよね。", "zh": "听好啰，亚利沙姊。\n以后记得训练课程开始前15分钟就要到事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1075_049mom", "source_sha256": "3c7cf5d79431215de4813af22334bb326b2063f6941390b00f78762fa74abfe2", "ja": "あと、撮ってくれた写真は、参考になると思うから……\nこの後のレッスンに、使わせてもらうね。", "zh": "还有，桃子觉得你拍的照片很有参考价值……\n所以之后会把它应用在训练课程上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1076_028ari", "source_sha256": "b341ad16f549026c5d282cc059639da3589725bef13828eb3e042bbd416de0af", "ja": "はいっ！　ありさ、もっともっと撮りますよぉ～っ！", "zh": "好的！亚利沙还会再拍更多照片～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1077_049mom", "source_sha256": "04a66b749ad4dfcdbb3f79ff109e4228c4728862aa4f3788b69d0767419a5219", "ja": "もうっ！　そうじゃなくって、\n亜利沙さんはレッスンに集中すること！", "zh": "真是的！不是这样啦，\n亚利沙姊应该要专心练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1078_p", "source_sha256": "0d74f405d096bcdb8d1fac7b5f4c1289db54ace20411d718f6bca98a7fd9ce41", "ja": "どうやら……もう心配ないみたいだな。\n春香も、お疲れ様。", "zh": "看来已经不用担心她们了。\n春香也是，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1079_001har", "source_sha256": "e645de75e34e25cc1931d7ef1fd7905207c896f64e3aac0211588c61d5cd3e1e", "ja": "そんな、私だって何もできませんでした。\nでも、これってきっと……。", "zh": "别这样说，我也没帮上什么忙。\n不过，我想这一定是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1080_001har", "source_sha256": "16da17cd66a271257ee9b6f0c2f63c49bb3647d408d0f0db0b5c66b4765860ea", "ja": "みんながちょっとずつ、\n頑張ってくれたおかげだって思います♪", "zh": "大家一点一滴付出努力的结果♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1081_p", "source_sha256": "4326b70329ec22a2e86171a5acfa9f9b0f17041fbee82f6d5d603c158e848158", "ja": "みんながちょっとずつ、か……。\nそうかもしれないな。", "zh": "大家一点一滴付出努力吗……\n或许真如你所说的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_05_1082_001har", "source_sha256": "ec77cb38a2e618cc8c176cca3e2c46201e0dcfa86117bdd9a43f59f4b3c506c4", "ja": "それじゃ、みんな！\n……リコッタのレッスン、始めよっか♪", "zh": "那么，大家！\n……开始『Ricotta』的训练课程吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
